<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazelness -->
  <Weazel_Weazelness.label>鼬族之道</Weazel_Weazelness.label>
  <!-- EN: The ideoligion of the Weazels, who serve First-Alpha. Women rule, everything that belongs to others is raided, and captured men are taken as trophies.\n\nBrings in the Weazel mod's 'Weazelness' ideoligion as it is. -->
  <Weazel_Weazelness.description>侍奉初代阿尔法的鼬族理念。女性统治，他人的一切都要掠夺，俘获的男性则被当作战利品。\n\n原封不动地引入鼬族模组的理念“鼬族之道”。</Weazel_Weazelness.description>
</LanguageData>
